#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:3
msgid ""
"`wisecrow graded-reader` generates a personalised CEFR-graded passage in the "
"foreign language, seeded from the vocabulary you've actually learned. The "
"LLM is instructed to reuse most of your seed words and add only a small "
"amount of new vocabulary at the level you specify."
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:10
msgid ""
"You're between A2 and B2 and want reading material that isn't humiliating or "
"insultingly easy."
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:12
msgid ""
"You want to consolidate vocabulary you've already drilled, in connected "
"prose rather than isolated cards."
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:14
msgid ""
"You want a glossary of the new words side-by-side, ready to feed back into "
"your SRS deck."
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:23
msgid "Alias: `wisecrow gr ...`."
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:27 src/guides/preview-subtitles.md:26
msgid "`--native-lang` / `-n`"
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:27
msgid "Native language code (used in glossary)."
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:28 src/guides/preview-subtitles.md:27
msgid "`--foreign-lang` / `-f`"
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:28
msgid "Foreign language code (passage language)."
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:29
msgid "`--cefr`"
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:29
msgid "CEFR level: `A1`, `A2`, `B1`, `B2`, `C1`, or `C2`."
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:30
msgid "`--seed-states`"
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:30
msgid ""
"FSRS states that count as \"learned\". Comma-separated `i16` list. `2` = "
"Review only. Pass `2,3` to also include Relearning (lapsed) cards."
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:31
msgid "`--seed-min-stability`"
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:31 src/guides/preview-subtitles.md:30
msgid "`None`"
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:31
msgid ""
"Optional FSRS-stability threshold. Cards below this stability are excluded "
"from the seed list."
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:32
msgid "`--seed-limit`"
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:32
msgid "`30`"
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:32
msgid "Max number of seed words pulled from the database."
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:33
msgid "`--length-words`"
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:33
msgid "`200`"
msgstr ""

#: src/guides/graded-reader.md:33
msgid "Approximate target length of the passage."
msgstr ""

