msgid "`translations` (idempotent merge by `GREATEST(frequency)`)"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/architecture.md:174
msgid "`grammar_rules` + `rule_examples`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/architecture.md:176
msgid ""
"The cursor is the remote primary key (`after_id`); successful runs update "
"`sync_metadata.last_synced_at` per `(remote_url, table_name)`."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/architecture.md:179
msgid "TUI"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/architecture.md:181
msgid ""
"The TUI uses [`ratatui`](https://ratatui.rs) with a tick rate of 100 ms. The "
"`learn` command's `app::run_tui` owns:"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/architecture.md:184
msgid "the deck and current index,"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/architecture.md:185
