msgid ""
"Pulls `languages`, `translations`, and `grammar_rules` from a remote "
"Wisecrow instance, paginated by primary key. `--api-key` is sent as the "
"`x-api-key` HTTP header. `sync_metadata.last_synced_at` is updated for each "
"table on success."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/cli-reference.md:321
msgid "`gloss`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/cli-reference.md:324
msgid "\"<TEXT>\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/cli-reference.md:327
msgid ""
"Produces a Leipzig interlinear gloss of `<TEXT>` in the given language. "
"Result is cached in the `glosses` table (SHA-256 of sentence × lang_code). "
"`--refresh` discards the cached value and re-prompts the LLM."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/cli-reference.md:333
msgid "See [Leipzig glossing](../guides/glossing.md) for the full guide."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/cli-reference.md:337
msgid "`graded-reader`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/cli-reference.md:346
msgid ""
"Generates a personalised passage at the given CEFR level seeded from cards "
"you've learned (FSRS state filter via `--seed-states`). Produces Markdown by "
"default; pass `--format html` for a self-contained viewable page."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/cli-reference.md:353
msgid "See [Graded reader](../guides/graded-reader.md) for the full guide."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/cli-reference.md:357
msgid "`preview`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/cli-reference.md:364
msgid ""
"Parses a `.srt`, `.vtt`, `.ass`, or `.ssa` subtitle file, tokenises with the "
"language-appropriate segmenter (jieba/lindera/kham/whitespace), and prints a "
"frequency-sorted table tagged with each token's SRS status. "
"`--gloss-unknowns` LLM-translates corpus-misses inline."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/cli-reference.md:369
msgid ""
"See [Subtitle preview](../guides/preview-subtitles.md) for the full guide."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/cli-reference.md:373
msgid "`user`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/cli-reference.md:382
msgid ""
"Manages accounts for the web application; there is no public signup, so the "
"first admin is created this way. `add` and `passwd` prompt for a password "
"unless `WISECROW__INIT_PASSWORD` is set, which allows non-interactive "
"provisioning. `disable` clears the password and revokes live sessions."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/cli-reference.md:389
msgid "`sync-client`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/cli-reference.md:397
msgid ""
"Issues per-client keys for the corpus-sync endpoints. `add` prints the key "
"once. Pullers send it as the `x-api-key` header; keys are individually "
"revocable and compared in constant time. See [Sync "
"workflow](../guides/sync-workflow.md)."
msgstr ""

