"Stores the start, peak, and end `n_level` plus the rolling accuracy figures. "
"A session is open until `completed_at` is set by "
"`DnbSessionRepository::complete_session`."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/database-schema.md:169
msgid "`dnb_trials`"
msgstr ""

