msgstr ""

#: src/reference/database-schema.md:238
msgid ""
"`idx_glosses_lookup (sentence_hash, lang_code)` — used by the gloss cache on "
"every `wisecrow gloss` call and TUI `g`\\-overlay fetch."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/troubleshooting.md:3
msgid ""
"A non-exhaustive list of failure modes and their root causes. Issues are "
